    <panel_attributes>title=SD04 Answer with retrieved citations
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=QuestionAnswerService~s
obj=RetrievalStrategy~r
obj=LLMClient~l
obj=ResponseParser~p
obj=CitationValidator~v

u-&gt;f : askQuestion(courseId, question)
f-&gt;s : answer(course, question)
s:Reject blank input
s-&gt;r : retrieve(question, course chunks, 5)
r.&gt;s : lexical matches ignoring common English words
s:If no chunks match, return a notice without a model request
combinedFragment=loop~answer s v; l:[At most two replies when chunks match]
s-&gt;l : generate(qaPrompt with retrieved IDs)
l.&gt;s : LLMResponse
s-&gt;p : parseCitedAnswer(text)
p.&gt;s : answer, cited IDs, needsClarification
s:If the model asks for clarification, return a labelled question
s-&gt;v : validate(ids, retrieved)
v.&gt;s : retrieved IDs only
s:Return cited answer when IDs remain, otherwise retain uncited text
--
s.&gt;f : Answer, Uncited answer, clarification or failure
f.&gt;u : returned answer or error
s:Invalid JSON is retried, retain the most recent nonempty model error</panel_attributes>
